[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2687030432","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103342#issuecomment-2687030432","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103342","id":2687030432,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gKNSg","user":{"login":"Rindbee","id":30386067,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMwMzg2MDY3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/30386067?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee","html_url":"https://github.com/Rindbee","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rindbee/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T06:28:34Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T06:32:36Z","body":"If you are just a game player, you can use the controller with the help of Steam:\n\n0. Open **Steam Settings**. Select **Controller** on the left, connect your device, and test your device input. Usually no changes are needed, but if there is a problem, you can reset the mapping.\n1. For non-steam games, add them to the library through the **Add Game** button in the lower left corner.\n2. Select the game in the library, right-click to open the menu, and select **Properties**\n3. Select **Controller** in the pop-up window, and then select **Enable Steam Input** in the drop-down menu on the right.\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb21b722-a56f-4cd8-9144-ecb5d6812641)\n\nAfter the configuration is completed, play the game through Steam. ","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2687030432/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2687209735","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/103342#issuecomment-2687209735","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103342","id":2687209735,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6gK5EH","user":{"login":"bitrot-alpha","id":55378293,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU1Mzc4Mjkz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/55378293?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha","html_url":"https://github.com/bitrot-alpha","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bitrot-alpha/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-27T08:15:36Z","updated_at":"2025-02-27T08:15:36Z","body":"@Rindbee Thanks for posting detailed instructions for others that may have this issue. I've already tried that, but it seems at least for Parking Garage Rally Circuit, that workaround doesn't work. Enabling Steam Input makes the game stop detecting any controller inpu